# RTN AXIOME

AXIOME is the Rosenberger Tunisia (RTN) plant access portal for the Enfidha factory.

- Do not rebrand this product as OTTO. OTTO is the Group ISMS; AXIOME is the RTN plant portal.
- Keep French UI copy for operator-facing screens.
- Demo login: `bilel.triaa@rosenberger.com` / `AXIOME2026!`
- Stack: pnpm workspaces, NestJS API (`:4000`), React/Vite web (`:5173`), PostgreSQL.
- Launch with `pnpm launch`.
